room_mapper links mapping_core (public-peppy-libs), which is GPL-3.0-or-later and
translates the code of slam_toolbox, Karto, Nav2's AMCL and Ceres Solver. The image ships
mapping_core's NOTICE, the BSD notices of the code it translates, beside the binary as
MAPPING_CORE_NOTICE, and the corresponding source is room_mapper's folder of nodes-hub at
the image's commit, with the libraries at the commits its Cargo.lock names.

room_mapper links Qhull through navigation_core, whose license the image ships beside the
binary as QHULL_COPYING.txt.
